{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "cielo-ticket-booking-flash-sale",
		"name": "Cielo Ticket Booking - Flash Sale Core",
		"description": "Collection de testes para a API de reserva de ingressos (Flash Booking) Case Técnico Cielo\n\nA collection será carregada com os scripts de teste automáticos: \nAo rodar a requisição 1 cria evento e o script grava automaticamente o UUID em eventId. \nAo rodar 3 reserva ingressos, a collection gera e mantém um Idempotency-Key para que reenvios sejam retries da mesma reserva e salva o reservationId gerado. Para iniciar uma nova reserva independente, limpe a variável idempotencyKey. A criação retorna 201; retry de uma reserva PENDING retorna 200 sem novo débito; reservas confirmadas, canceladas ou expiradas retornam 409. \nAs requisições de confirmação, consulta e cancelamento usam o ID salvo na variável da collection.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "baseUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:8080",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "eventId",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "reservationId",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "idempotencyKey",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Criar Evento (POST /events)",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"exec": [
							"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
							"    var data = pm.response.json();",
							"    pm.collectionVariables.set('eventId', data.id);",
							"    console.log('eventId salvo:', data.id);",
							"}"
						],
						"type": "text/javascript"
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "Content-Type",
						"value": "application/json"
					}
				],
				"body": {
					"mode": "raw",
					"raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Show de Abertura Flash Sale\",\n  \"totalCapacity\": 100\n}"
				},
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/events",
					"host": [
						"{{baseUrl}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"events"
					]
				}
			},
			"response": []
		},
		{
			"name": "2. Consultar Disponibilidade (GET /events/:id)",
			"request": {
				"method": "GET",
				"header": [],
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}",
					"host": [
						"{{baseUrl}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"events",
						"{{eventId}}"
					]
				}
			},
			"response": []
		},
		{
			"name": "3. Reservar Ingressos (POST /events/:id/reservations)",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "prerequest",
					"script": {
						"exec": [
							"let idempotencyKey = pm.collectionVariables.get('idempotencyKey');",
							"if (!idempotencyKey) {",
							"    idempotencyKey = pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}');",
							"    pm.collectionVariables.set('idempotencyKey', idempotencyKey);",
							"}"
						],
						"type": "text/javascript"
					}
				},
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"exec": [
							"if (pm.response.code === 201 || pm.response.code === 200) {",
							"    var data = pm.response.json();",
							"    pm.collectionVariables.set('reservationId', data.id);",
							"    console.log('reservationId salvo:', data.id);",
							"}"
						],
						"type": "text/javascript"
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "Content-Type",
						"value": "application/json"
					},
					{
						"key": "Idempotency-Key",
						"value": "{{$guid}}",
						"description": "Chave de idempotência única gerada para a requisição"
					}
				],
				"body": {
					"mode": "raw",
					"raw": "{\n  \"customerId\": \"cli-9921\",\n  \"quantity\": 2\n}"
				},
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/reservations",
					"host": [
						"{{baseUrl}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"events",
						"{{eventId}}",
						"reservations"
					]
				}
			},
			"response": []
		},
		{
			"name": "4. Confirmar Reserva (POST /reservations/:id/confirm)",
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [],
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/confirm",
					"host": [
						"{{baseUrl}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"reservations",
						"{{reservationId}}",
						"confirm"
					]
				},
				"description": "Confirma uma reserva PENDING ainda não expirada. Endpoint demonstrativo; não representa confirmação de pagamento real."
			},
			"response": []
		},
		{
			"name": "5. Consultar Reserva (GET /reservations/:id)",
			"request": {
				"method": "GET",
				"header": [],
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}",
					"host": [
						"{{baseUrl}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"reservations",
						"{{reservationId}}"
					]
				}
			},
			"response": []
		},
		{
			"name": "6. Cancelar Reserva (DELETE /reservations/:id)",
			"request": {
				"method": "DELETE",
				"header": [],
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}",
					"host": [
						"{{baseUrl}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"reservations",
						"{{reservationId}}"
					]
				},
				"description": "Cancela somente reservas PENDING. Reservas CONFIRMED não podem ser canceladas e retornam 409 Conflict. Para testar o cancelamento com sucesso, execute antes de confirmar a reserva."
			},
			"response": []
		}
	]
}